your site.yaml file and the built website files. You may keep, change, host and use your website
anywhere, including commercially. No fee is due and no credit to Forge is needed on the site.

ENGINE CODE IN AN EXPORT
An export of your site includes the parts of Forge needed to build it. You may use, change and host
that code, free of charge, only to build, run and maintain that website. You may not redistribute it
on its own, or use it to offer a website builder, template or theme product. Keep this file with the
export.

